[en.IDEA_ALL_IDEOLOGY_GESTALT]
Gestalt Consciousness

[en.IDEA_ALL_IDEOLOGY_GESTALT_desc]
Achieved complete unity of spirit, individual consciousness no longer exists. The entire country only exists as one individual, and each specific body is only an organ like a finger.

[zh.IDEA_ALL_IDEOLOGY_GESTALT]
格式塔意识

[zh.IDEA_ALL_IDEOLOGY_GESTALT_desc]
实现了精神的完全统一，个体意识不复存在。整个国家只存在一个个体，而每个具体的肉身都只像是手指头一般的器官罢了。
